From ae05b4f749443969d554a9b2c6954328286d5807 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lij768423-svg <lij768423@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:20:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: bound auto-assign share and per-cycle migrations

Add optional routing.autoAssignMaxNodeShare and
autoAssignMaxMigrationShare. Default 0 keeps the historical unbounded
first-pass evacuation and the existing 200-move repair ceiling. Values
in [0.05, 1] cap how many active accounts one healthy node may absorb
and how many already-bound accounts may move in one cycle.
